WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.650
Hi, I'm Ahmed Baghouli — a full-stack
and AI developer from Tunisia.

00:05.900 --> 00:12.000
I'm in my third year of Computer Science
and Multimedia at Université Sesame,

00:12.000 --> 00:12.200
and I learn the way I like to work:
by shipping real things.

00:12.200 --> 00:29.150
I built AI Eyes, an Arabic-first vision
assistant for blind and low-vision people;
Cheezy, the ordering platform a real bakery
uses every day; and a radar tracker that
holds on to its target through the noise.

00:29.500 --> 00:37.150
Next, I'm heading for a Master's in Artificial
Intelligence — natural language processing
and computer vision — and then research.

00:37.450 --> 00:42.350
My motto: nothing is gained without giving
something of equal worth. So I work hard.

00:42.650 --> 00:48.750
If you're building something that matters,
let's talk. My work and my email are right
here on this page.
